{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國電商巨頭亞馬遜近日公開反對紐約市一項新的勞工法案，並向當地消費者發出警告稱，如果相關法案最終成為法律，紐約居民未來每筆訂單的配送成本可能增加最高5美元，同時包裹配送速度也可能受到影響。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587318.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T17:24:32.591101+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T17:09:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T17:17:39.549462+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T17:17:39.549462+00:00","content_hash":"aa9f682dbf05cd3f625df0bf24e783c74d7aff5539b1b08aba192c9c5e1d32b4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}